{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Summary:<br>Today marks your first day as the newly appointed CEO of the company. You firmly believe that imposing taxes can revive the company from the brink of bankruptcy. Every morning, you use a custom-designed wheel to spin and determine the tax rate for the day. You also have a highly intelligent AI assistant that provides you with perfectly optimized operational advice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Goals and Challenges:\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>The company has three key metrics: \u200b<strong>Company Economy</strong>, \u200b<strong>Approval Rating</strong>, and \u200b<strong>Stability</strong>. Under the CEO's aggressive tax hikes, you\u2014as the player\u2014must make choices from the options provided by the AI assistant to ensure none of these metrics drop to zero, as the consequences would be dire. Along the way, you will encounter special random events requiring critical decisions, each of which will impact the three metrics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Try it out!\u200b</strong>\u200b See if you can survive 10 days and achieve the highest score possible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706720?t=1748595596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706720/647e282f4e81ec248277a4bfea9f336121457ba6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748595596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706720/298c69b8bf3b32077e20c972a0070c6e768e4660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748595596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706720/298c69b8bf3b32077e20c972a0070c6e768e4660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748595596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_